docsite/static/designs/jetson-power.svg is rendered from the Antmicro baseboard for
Jetson AGX Thor, Copyright (c) 2025-2026 Antmicro, licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0. The board's design files are fetched into tools/samples/ and are not
committed here, apart from three small cuts. readers/kicad/testdata/orient-jetson-caps.kicad_sch
and orient-jetson-fet.kicad_sch each keep a few parts of one sheet (USB Debug, PD and Power),
unchanged. examples/cross-probe-project/designs/jetson-cut keeps nineteen parts of those two sheets
with the board's footprints and copper around them, cut by tools/kicadcut, which drops footprint
artwork on the User layers and renames the board's nets to the cut schematic's. All three are under
the same copyright and licence.
